# ─── data/results/ policy ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# We SHIP (for reproducibility + audit of the paper's Table 3-5):
#   - feedback.csv                                    (T1/T2/T3 feedback data)
#   - responses_qwen80b_thinking.csv                  (GRPO --meta-data source)
#   - responses_simulate_student_authentic_*.csv      (Table 3 baseline responses)
#   - judgments_simulate_student_authentic_*.csv      (Table 3 baseline judgments)
#   - responses_{sft_*, grpo_*_b16*, grpo_*_004*}.csv (Table 4/5 trained responses)
#   - judgments_{sft_*, grpo_*_b16*, grpo_*_004*}.csv (Table 4/5 trained judgments)
#
# We DO NOT ship response/judgment CSVs from ablation / rebuttal experiments
# (adversarial paraphrase, oracle, held-out, DPO, alternate GRPO configs).
# Those are kept in separate branches to keep the main branch focused on
# artifacts that back the paper's headline tables.

# Rebuttal / ablation artifacts (kept in separate branches).
